     "en": "The Greeks told how the world began, and how Zeus became king of the gods."
    },
    {
     "es": "Al principio no había nada, solo un espacio enorme, oscuro y vacío.",
     "en": "At first there was nothing, only a huge, dark, empty space."
    },
    {
     "es": "Después apareció la Tierra. Era una diosa, y se llamaba Gea.",
     "en": "Then the Earth appeared. She was a goddess, and her name was Gaia."
    }
